  "body": "Aside from removing 'All' from getAll\\* methods (#40) and removing a few of getAll\\* methods (#39), we could specify in the interface that we're returning only primary services.\n\nDebating with myself, this would however not be in line with most native APIs, which solely specify getService(s).\n\nThis would give:\n`BluetoothDevice.getPrimaryService(s)`\n",
